  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.40 - (January 19, 2026)\n- FIXED: Component variable scoping issue where callback-set variables (like 'element') could leak between sibling components.\n- IMPROVED: Variable isolation with robust engine-to-evaluator sync logic.\n- ADDED: OldName fallback to Name if not explicitly provided, improving database lookup reliability in callbacks.\n- ADDED: Support for {{oldname}} variable access directly within component templates.\n- FIXED: BlockParser now correctly handles OldName fallbacks during template extraction.",
